OL,3,ATrump gave $45,000 cash gifts to
OL,4,ANatalie Harp and two other aides,
OL,5,Apublic records show
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump gave sizable
OL,8,Fcash gifts to four White House
OL,9,Fstaffers, including $45,000 (#33,000)
OL,10,Fto his close aide Natalie Harp,
OL,11,Ffinancial disclosures released by his
OL,12,Fadministration show.
OL,14,FTwo staff members got the same amount
OL,15,Fas Harp, while his longtime aide and
OL,16,Fdirector of Oval Office Operations,
OL,17,FWalt Nauta, received $22,000.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
