OL,3,ATrump gave $45,000 cash gifts to
OL,4,ANatalie Harp and two other aides,
OL,5,Apublic records show
OL,6,
OL,7,FNo other White House staffer has
OL,8,Fdeclared any gifts from the president,
OL,9,Fthe documents show. Federal employees
OL,10,Fare prohibited from receiving outside
OL,11,Fcompensation for their duties.
OL,13,FThe White House has described the gifts
OL,14,Fas personal in nature, unrelated to the
OL,15,Fstaffers' work and legal under US law.
